//api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally on the MRP from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100846 (rebased on top of `master`), I found some issues.\r\n\r\nOn my end, the behavior already appeared to work fine on `master` when following these instructions:\r\n\r\n- Double-check the particle's emission mode is **Directed Points** and not **Points** (it was set to **Points** when I first opened the MRP).\r\n- When testing the MRP, make sure to set **Spread** to `0.0` and **Direction** to `(0, 0, 0)` in the ParticleProcessMaterial.\r\n- Regenerate the emission points with **Surface+Normal (Directed)**.\r\n\r\nThis PR also introduces a regression: when generating emission points with **Surface+Normal (Directed)**, the emission mode is no longer switched to **Directed Points** automatically. It will switch to **Points** instead (e.g. if you have **Box** selected).\r\n\r\nWe should also document the fact that **Direction** being set to `(0, 0, 0)` is a special case when using directed point emission. Non-zero directions *are* valid to create particles that are emitted along a surface (not going away from it), but are probably not what most users expect.\r\n\r\n### Before\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f898cf39-d735-4991-b75e-60de93101775\r\n\r\n### After\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3740cf9f-7359-4f0f-bd28-5a10cf3d8490","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117859#pullrequestreview-4282471078","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117859","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117859#pullrequestreview-4282471078"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117859"}},"submitted_at":"2026-05-13T14:14:07Z","commit_id":"106930166a5ab7946983dff4179a371800ffa557"}]